# Test that [macro name [let params] body] parses and registers correctly.
# MacroDecl is filtered from post-expansion AST and not typechecked directly.
[macro my-if [let cond then else] [quote [if [unquote cond] [unquote then] [unquote else]]]]
=== out
[macro my-if [let cond then else] [quote [if [unquote cond] [unquote then] [unquote else]]]]
